WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,770 --> 00:00:05,630
Shiying, you are right

2
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:07,230
Should be early

3
00:00:07,230 --> 00:00:08,910
Sister Chen Yao, don’t talk.

4
00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:18,320
Save your energy, Sister Wei Rui

5
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:19,720
Still can't light the fire

6
00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,920
Chai Quan is wet

7
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,560
I think stop talking

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,610
Brother Lin Feng, there is cigarettes there

9
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:26,730
His fire is still burning

10
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:35,320
Nothing happened at his camp

11
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,790
There is fire and food there

12
00:00:37,990 --> 00:00:38,990
Maybe there is some medicine

13
00:00:39,270 --> 00:00:41,340
No one is allowed to beg him

14
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:45,230
You have to change into dry clothes first

15
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:46,550
Find another warm place

16
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:48,830
What should Chen Yao do?

17
00:00:48,950 --> 00:00:51,550
He burned all night and even if he took it off, he wouldn't be able to save his life.

18
00:00:51,750 --> 00:00:52,790
I'm going to find Jiang Yue

19
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:54,430
He might have a fine there

20
00:01:06,100 --> 00:01:08,540
Jiang Yue, Chen Yao is seriously ill. Do you have any medicine?

21
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:13,020
I only have salt and no medicine. Is there anything you can do? You know so much.

22
00:01:13,860 --> 00:01:16,060
Understanding the weather does not mean knowing how to treat diseases

23
00:01:16,750 --> 00:01:18,310
He was caught in the rain and burned like this

24
00:01:18,950 --> 00:01:20,630
What is needed is a doctor and medicine

25
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:21,870
not a teacher

26
00:01:22,030 --> 00:01:23,950
Our firewood is all wet

27
00:01:23,950 --> 00:01:24,990
Can't even raise the fire

28
00:01:24,990 --> 00:01:26,150
How to keep him cold?

29
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,340
I still have half a bucket of hot water here, take it first

30
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:31,220
You figure out the rest yourself

31
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:32,940
Su Weiwei, you know very well

32
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,420
Who can save Chen Yao on this island?

33
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:36,300
Not me, but that person
